## Crate-by-Crate Breakdown

### 1. `rot-cli` — Entry Point

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| [main.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/main.rs) | Tokio [main](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/main.rs#12-176), command dispatch, config loading |
| [cli.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/cli.rs) | Clap-based CLI argument definitions |
| [provider_factory.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/provider_factory.rs) | Constructs the right [Provider](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/traits.rs#13-39) from CLI flags |
| [commands/chat.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/commands/chat.rs) | Interactive TUI chat mode |
| [commands/exec.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-cli/src/commands/exec.rs) | Single-shot execution mode |

**Commands**: [chat](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-tui/src/app.rs#301-309) (default), [exec](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-rlm/src/engine.rs#28-34), [session](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent.rs#132-137) (list/tree/resume/export/import), `tools`, `providers`, [models](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-rlm/src/engine.rs#498-508), `serve`.

---

### 2. `rot-core` — Agent Loop & Brain

The heart of the system. Key files:

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| [agent.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent.rs) | **1538 lines.** The main agent loop: send→stream→parse→tools→repeat |
| [message.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/message.rs) | `Message`, `ContentBlock` (Text, ToolCall, ToolResult, Thinking, Image), `Role` |
| [config.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/config.rs) | [Config](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent.rs#58-70), `ConfigStore` — reads `~/.rot/config.json` |
| [security.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/security.rs) | [RuntimeSecurityConfig](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/security.rs#33-41), `ApprovalPolicy`, `SandboxMode` |
| [permission.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/permission.rs) | Permission checking for tool execution |
| [agent_profile.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent_profile.rs) | `AgentProfile`, `AgentMode` — named agent personas |
| [agent_registry.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent_registry.rs) | Registry of available agent profiles |
| [swarm.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/swarm.rs) | Multi-agent swarm orchestration |
| [task_scheduler.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/task_scheduler.rs) | Task delegation and scheduling |

**Agent loop flow**: User Input → build provider context → stream LLM response → parse `StreamEvent`s → if tool calls: check permissions → execute tools → loop back. Max 50 iterations. Supports `EventCallback` for TUI streaming and `ApprovalCallback` for interactive permission prompts.

The agent also supports **task delegation** via [AgentTaskRunner](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-core/src/agent.rs#490-496) — sub-agents that can be spawned with their own message history via a `TaskTool`.

