### 3. `rot-provider` — LLM Provider Abstraction

**Core trait** ([traits.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/traits.rs)):
```rust
trait Provider: Send + Sync {
    fn name(&self) -> &str;
    fn models(&self) -> Vec<ModelInfo>;
    fn current_model(&self) -> &str;
    fn set_model(&mut self, model: &str) -> Result<(), ProviderError>;
    async fn stream(&self, request: Request) -> Result<BoxStream<StreamEvent>>;
    async fn complete(&self, request: Request) -> Result<Response>;
}
```

**7 provider implementations**:

| Provider | File | Notes |
|----------|------|-------|
| Anthropic | [anthropic.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/anthropic.rs) | Native Claude API with thinking support |
| OpenAI | [openai.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/openai.rs) | GPT-4o, o-series |
| Google | [google.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/google.rs) | Gemini models (1M context) |
| Ollama | [ollama.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/ollama.rs) | Local models |
| OpenRouter | [openrouter.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/openrouter.rs) | OpenRouter API gateway |
| ZAI | [zai.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/zai.rs) | GLM models |
| OpenAI-Compat | [openai_compat.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/openai_compat.rs) | Generic OpenAI-compatible endpoints |
| Mock | [mock.rs](file:///Users/akashrathod/Desktop/projects/rot/crates/rot-provider/src/providers/mock.rs) | For testing |

All providers normalize to a common `StreamEvent` enum (TextDelta, ToolCallStart, ToolCallDelta, ThinkingDelta, Done, Error, Usage).

